Come do it, come do it, I love you

00:00:15.080 --> 00:00:20.650
kakkokakko kakkouyoi anata wa otokonoko

00:00:15.080 --> 00:00:20.650
Cool, cool, you're so cool. You're a boy.

00:00:20.650 --> 00:00:23.250
kakkokakko kakkotoji

00:00:20.650 --> 00:00:23.250
Close close (close) parenthesis

00:00:23.250 --> 00:00:25.620
nee dare wo miteiruno

00:00:23.250 --> 00:00:25.620
Hey, who are you looking at?

00:00:26.130 --> 00:00:31.810
fuwafuwa marukkoi watashi wa onnanoko

00:00:26.130 --> 00:00:31.810
Fluffy-fluffy and bouncy, I am a girl.

00:00:31.810 --> 00:00:34.300
fuwafuwa dawawawa

00:00:31.810 --> 00:00:34.300
Fluffy-fluff, fluff!

00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:36.260
kocchi wo muiteyo

00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:36.260
Looking this way!

00:00:36.260 --> 00:00:42.190
koinohajimari wa watashikara sukininari

00:00:36.260 --> 00:00:42.190
Love begins when I have a crush

00:00:42.640 --> 00:00:48.650
demokonosaki wa socchikara onegai

00:00:42.640 --> 00:00:48.650
But before that, you have to ask me

00:00:48.650 --> 00:00:54.150
toikimajiri uttori koukishin wa docchari

00:00:48.650 --> 00:00:54.150
Which caused your spellbound gasping curiosity?

00:00:54.150 --> 00:00:58.490
korekara iitokoro

00:00:54.150 --> 00:00:58.490
It gets good from here

00:00:58.490 --> 00:00:59.780
toraburutte

00:00:58.490 --> 00:00:59.780
Trouble is!

00:00:59.780 --> 00:01:05.370
mawarumawaru chikkyu chiguhagu mirakuru

00:00:59.780 --> 00:01:05.370
The spinning, spinning Earth's mismatched miracle

00:01:05.370 --> 00:01:08.000
oikakekkoshiteru

00:01:05.370 --> 00:01:08.000
Chasing after it

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:10.960
watashi watashi kokodesuyo

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:10.960
I am, I am over here!

00:01:10.960 --> 00:01:16.380
mawarumawaru sekai anata ga yondemo

00:01:10.960 --> 00:01:16.380
In this spinning, spinning world, even if you call

00:01:16.380 --> 00:01:22.160
shiran kaoshichao tsukamacchattara makeyo

00:01:16.380 --> 00:01:22.160
You lose if I catch you pretending to not know

00:01:22.160 --> 00:01:24.820
mainichi mainichi ukiuki

00:01:22.160 --> 00:01:24.820
Everyday, everyday cheery and happy

00:01:24.820 --> 00:01:27.800
yattekita yattekita daisuki

00:01:24.820 --> 00:01:27.800
You're here, you're here, I love you!

00:01:27.800 --> 00:01:29.010
daisuki

00:01:27.800 --> 00:01:29.010
I love you!

00:01:44.870 --> 00:01:46.930
Stop it.

00:01:52.700 --> 00:01:55.190
Lala, you're in my bed again?!

00:02:00.340 --> 00:02:01.540
Momo?

00:02:01.540 --> 00:02:05.180
Good morning. How was your wake-up?

00:02:07.630 --> 00:02:10.810
Rito, it's almost time for school...

00:02:13.760 --> 00:02:14.530
Rito?

00:02:14.530 --> 00:02:16.280
No, no, no! This is a...

00:02:16.530 --> 00:02:18.200
Hey!

00:02:19.070 --> 00:02:21.420
Why are you sleeping with Momo?!

00:02:21.420 --> 00:02:22.280
It's a misunderstanding!

00:02:22.620 --> 00:02:24.410
When I woke up, Momo was—

00:02:24.410 --> 00:02:27.080
Oh, "when you woke up," you say...

00:02:27.910 --> 00:02:33.110
Rito-san, you don't remember <i>anything</i> from last night, do you?

00:02:35.950 --> 00:02:40.130
What do you mean by... "last night"?

00:02:40.130 --> 00:02:42.640
You!

00:02:46.130 --> 00:02:48.030
What are you trying to pull, Momo?

00:02:48.030 --> 00:02:49.430
What are you talking about?

00:02:50.170 --> 00:02:52.690
Sneaking into that beast's bed like that.

00:02:52.950 --> 00:02:54.990
Rito-san's a beast?

00:02:56.190 --> 00:02:57.660
What are you blushing for?

00:02:57.660 --> 00:02:58.690
Because...

00:02:59.170 --> 00:03:02.670
In the first place, he's Sis's fiancé, you know?

00:03:02.670 --> 00:03:08.300
I know that, but it doesn't matter who he's with, right?

00:03:08.710 --> 00:03:11.420
Plus, I'm fine with this.{It means lover, but I think more appropriately for this case, mistress}

00:03:12.220 --> 00:03:12.920
"This"?

00:03:14.280 --> 00:03:16.600
It might be too early for you, Nana.

00:03:16.600 --> 00:03:19.130
Each person expresses love differently.

00:03:19.740 --> 00:03:21.710
I have no idea what you're talking about.

00:03:21.710 --> 00:03:24.480
What's so good about him anyway?

00:03:24.480 --> 00:03:26.470
He's weak and exceptionally ordinary.

00:03:26.830 --> 00:03:28.350
Then...

00:03:28.350 --> 00:03:30.640
why don't you see for yourself?

00:03:32.120 --> 00:03:36.960
Nana and Momo

00:03:38.690 --> 00:03:40.440
They said they found a good spot{ to go}.

00:03:40.810 --> 00:03:43.260
Then we can go after school, right?

00:03:43.260 --> 00:03:45.450
Yeah, I told Mikan earlier.

00:03:45.780 --> 00:03:48.830
Since we already went through the trouble of setting it up, let's just sit back and relax.

00:03:48.830 --> 00:03:51.590
Yeah, it'll be fun!

00:03:51.590 --> 00:03:53.430
Th-They're touching me.

00:03:53.980 --> 00:03:54.780
What are?

00:03:54.780 --> 00:03:56.630
N-Nothing.

00:04:00.140 --> 00:04:03.260
Honestly, why do we have to go check him out in the first place?

00:04:03.260 --> 00:04:07.780
Isn't it best to see someone in their natural environment when you want to get to know them?

00:04:07.780 --> 00:04:09.180
Are you sure about that?

00:04:10.360 --> 00:04:11.640
There they are.

00:04:13.430 --> 00:04:15.170
Good morning!

00:04:17.600 --> 00:04:20.070
Good morning, Yuuki-kun, Lala-san.

00:04:20.580 --> 00:04:22.530
Good morning, Sairenji, Oshizu-chan.

00:04:27.790 --> 00:04:28.910
Yuuki-kun?!

00:04:28.910 --> 00:04:29.830
Rito!

00:04:29.830 --> 00:04:35.780
As expected of Haruna-san. You dodged that effortlessly, like it's become second nature{you must have gotten used to it}.

00:04:37.630 --> 00:04:39.270
Yuuki-kun, are you okay?

00:04:41.250 --> 00:04:45.550
You should pay more attention when you're walking, Rito.

00:04:45.550 --> 00:04:48.180
I'm paying plenty of attention.

00:04:49.540 --> 00:04:50.390
What a klutz.

00:04:50.390 --> 00:04:53.320
Seriously, tripping on a can?

00:04:56.350 --> 00:04:59.130
Like I said, don't stick to me like that.

00:04:59.730 --> 00:05:05.700
Yuuki-kun, Lala-san, I will not permit you to act perverted on campus!

00:05:05.700 --> 00:05:07.310
Now get away from her.

00:05:07.310 --> 00:05:08.620
No!

00:05:08.620 --> 00:05:09.910
Rito-kyun!

00:05:10.830 --> 00:05:12.830
I found you!

00:05:28.560 --> 00:05:29.990
What an animal...{beast?}

00:05:29.990 --> 00:05:32.380
Oh, what a surprise...

00:05:33.340 --> 00:05:35.180
Ow...

00:05:46.400 --> 00:05:47.570
You saw them, didn't you?

00:05:47.570 --> 00:05:48.940
N-N—.

00:05:50.030 --> 00:05:50.740
I have to kill you now.

00:05:51.620 --> 00:05:54.080
No matter what I say, it always ends up like this!{I didn't even answer you!}

00:05:55.040 --> 00:05:56.230
Weakling...

00:05:56.230 --> 00:05:59.330
Rather, it's more like the opponent is too strong.

00:06:00.880 --> 00:06:03.990
Just as I thought, he's a worthless human.

00:06:03.990 --> 00:06:06.510
Hm... that's strange.

00:06:06.510 --> 00:06:11.050
Maybe his strength only shows itself during an emergency.

00:06:11.050 --> 00:06:12.190
"Emergency"?

00:06:12.190 --> 00:06:15.340
As they say, "a strong falcon hides its claws."

00:06:15.340 --> 00:06:18.040
So when is that "emergency" coming?

00:06:18.040 --> 00:06:20.780
Oh, that'll be easy to take care of.

00:06:21.030 --> 00:06:22.690
Dash!

00:06:22.850 --> 00:06:24.630
You're doing great!

00:06:24.630 --> 00:06:25.820
Go, go!

00:06:26.990 --> 00:06:33.200
Using your ability to talk to animals, my ability to talk to plants,

00:06:34.280 --> 00:06:39.290
and this teleportation device that Onee-sama made, we can conjure one up, right?

00:06:39.290 --> 00:06:41.340
Well, I guess we can.

00:06:41.340 --> 00:06:42.750
Let's just go for it.

00:06:42.750 --> 00:06:43.820
Okay.

00:06:48.060 --> 00:06:51.290
A friend from Shishinabe—Gikai's Wild Boar, Gii!

00:06:51.290 --> 00:06:52.550
Go!

00:06:54.710 --> 00:06:55.760
What the heck is that?!

00:06:57.460 --> 00:06:59.020
A wild boar?!

00:07:15.610 --> 00:07:17.490
Hold it right there, Yuuki Rito!

00:07:17.490 --> 00:07:19.700
Why do you always get in my way?!

00:07:19.700 --> 00:07:21.700
I'm sorry!

00:07:24.830 --> 00:07:26.290
We didn't do anything yet!

00:07:29.460 --> 00:07:31.390
Are you okay, Rito? {Lala is cute here}

00:07:31.390 --> 00:07:34.330
Yeah, this is pretty normal.{this is normal}

00:07:35.860 --> 00:07:36.880
But...

00:07:38.980 --> 00:07:43.270
it feels three times worse than usual...

00:07:44.760 --> 00:07:47.360
I was right. He's a worthless human.

00:07:47.360 --> 00:07:49.780
He's just an idiot, end of story!

00:07:50.170 --> 00:07:51.850
Something doesn't seem right.

00:07:51.850 --> 00:07:54.200
It's not supposed to be this way.

00:07:54.200 --> 00:07:58.160
You, Sis, and everyone else just have the wrong idea about him.

00:07:58.160 --> 00:08:01.500
Even after all that, his strength didn't show itself even once.

00:08:02.210 --> 00:08:05.590
It's like I said in the first place, he's just an ordinary—

00:08:05.590 --> 00:08:08.100
Maybe we've been exposed...

00:08:08.840 --> 00:08:13.480
Maybe he knows that we're watching and he's purposely doing everything wrong.

00:08:13.480 --> 00:08:15.020
Why would he do that?

00:08:15.020 --> 00:08:25.190
I don't know why, but... we know that everyone likes to be around him for <i>some</i> reason, right?

00:08:27.050 --> 00:08:28.650
Well... yeah...

00:08:28.990 --> 00:08:33.330
And if Onee-sama likes him so much, there has to be a reason.

00:08:33.330 --> 00:08:37.500
So you're saying that he's been fooling us this whole time?

00:08:39.080 --> 00:08:43.940
What did you expect? Things always turn out like this when you take charge, Momo.

00:08:43.940 --> 00:08:47.750
It won't work out the way you want it to if you just go around acting like a good girl.

00:08:48.170 --> 00:08:53.260
Well, if we compare the two of us, I <i>am</i> the more competent one. I guess it can't be helped.

00:08:53.580 --> 00:08:57.640
Since I'm better than you, I should be the one to come up with a plan.

00:08:58.820 --> 00:09:00.600
Is that all you wanted to say?

00:09:02.710 --> 00:09:05.100
My tail... that's cheating...

00:09:10.320 --> 00:09:11.250
You!

00:09:12.840 --> 00:09:13.990
Here's payback!

00:09:15.680 --> 00:09:17.570
Hey, let go!

00:09:18.260 --> 00:09:19.700
<i>You</i> let go!

00:09:23.320 --> 00:09:24.770
Let go!

00:09:24.770 --> 00:09:25.580
Let go!

00:09:29.690 --> 00:09:34.010
Sorry to interrupt you, but it's about time.

00:09:34.010 --> 00:09:35.300
Time?

00:09:36.220 --> 00:09:39.300
Cherry blossom viewing?

00:09:39.300 --> 00:09:44.810
Yep. We'll all watch the blossoms together while we have lunch and drink juice.

00:09:44.810 --> 00:09:52.020
To us Japanese, this is an annual tradition that can only be done this time of year.

00:09:53.050 --> 00:09:54.940
That sounds pretty interesting.

00:09:54.940 --> 00:09:57.150
Why don't you two join us?

00:09:57.150 --> 00:09:59.160
Of course we'll go—

00:10:00.200 --> 00:10:01.900
I'm sorry.

00:10:01.900 --> 00:10:08.920
Although I'm happy that you invited us, we both have really important matters to attend to.

00:10:09.240 --> 00:10:12.670
Huh? We have something plan—

00:10:12.670 --> 00:10:16.380
So regretfully, we must decline.

00:10:16.840 --> 00:10:19.440
Please enjoy yourselves.

00:10:20.630 --> 00:10:22.050
Let's go, let's go, let's go.

00:10:20.980 --> 00:10:22.050
Wait a minute. {overlap}

00:10:24.810 --> 00:10:26.470
What's the meaning of this?

00:10:26.470 --> 00:10:28.860
They went to the trouble of inviting us and all.

00:10:28.860 --> 00:10:30.200
What are you saying?

00:10:30.200 --> 00:10:31.570
This is our chance.

00:10:31.570 --> 00:10:32.270
Huh?

00:10:32.270 --> 00:10:34.170
Not "huh?"

00:10:34.170 --> 00:10:36.530
We're going to have a perfect opportunity to see Rito-san's true personality.

00:10:36.900 --> 00:10:39.490
Perfect Opportunity? How?

00:10:40.070 --> 00:10:43.320
Don't worry, I have a plan.

00:11:11.020 --> 00:11:12.990
What pretty sakura blossoms!

00:11:12.990 --> 00:11:14.940
They're already in full bloom, aren't they?

00:11:14.940 --> 00:11:18.520
Yeah, it would have been nice if Nana and Momo could have come too.

00:11:18.520 --> 00:11:20.240
Lala-san.

00:11:20.800 --> 00:11:22.910
Haruna, Oshizu-chan!

00:11:22.910 --> 00:11:24.470
You guys were already here?

00:11:24.470 --> 00:11:26.450
We arrived a bit early.

00:11:26.450 --> 00:11:27.470
No problem!

00:11:27.470 --> 00:11:30.160
Now let's put down the sheets and start viewing!

00:11:37.490 --> 00:11:39.450
How does it taste, Yami-san?{omg VA fail. She said Yumi-san}

00:11:40.430 --> 00:11:41.830
It's delicious.

00:11:43.060 --> 00:11:45.040
Still, you guys found a pretty nice spot.

00:11:45.040 --> 00:11:46.970
Seriously, we lucked out.

00:11:47.340 --> 00:11:50.450
The weather is perfect for cherry blossom viewing, isn't it?

00:11:50.450 --> 00:11:52.100
Yeah, it's great.

00:11:53.390 --> 00:11:55.110
What are we going to do?

00:11:55.110 --> 00:11:56.610
We're going to do this.

00:11:59.550 --> 00:12:01.520
Yo!{I think this is a slang for hello}

00:12:01.520 --> 00:12:02.710
This is...

00:12:02.710 --> 00:12:07.080
This is an acquaintance of mine from the Cedar planet, Sugitani-san.

00:12:07.790 --> 00:12:14.720
If you inhale its pollen, your suppressed desires surface, revealing your true self.

00:12:15.270 --> 00:12:17.500
I don't get it.

00:12:17.500 --> 00:12:23.680
Basically, we're going to get Rito-san drunk with this to make him show his true self.

00:12:24.220 --> 00:12:25.890
I'm counting on you, Sugitani-san.

00:12:26.150 --> 00:12:28.060
{}

00:12:28.650 --> 00:12:31.430
{}

00:12:43.970 --> 00:12:45.070
It's started.

00:12:46.520 --> 00:12:48.450
Hey, Yuuki-kun?

00:12:48.450 --> 00:12:50.160
Y-Yes?

00:12:52.610 --> 00:12:54.830
Why don't you come out and say it already?!

00:12:56.430 --> 00:12:58.540
Right off the bat, she's gone off the deep end!

00:12:58.940 --> 00:13:05.190
I was ready to answer you from the very beginning.  Do you think you can leave it hanging forever?!

00:13:05.190 --> 00:13:08.330
S-Sairenji, what exactly are you talking about?

00:13:11.350 --> 00:13:12.600
Now she's started crying!

00:13:13.370 --> 00:13:15.310
It's already decided, isn't it?

00:13:15.310 --> 00:13:17.520
Your feelings...

00:13:17.520 --> 00:13:19.250
I've always...

00:13:19.250 --> 00:13:20.270
always...

00:13:22.410 --> 00:13:24.490
Sairenji...

00:13:24.490 --> 00:13:25.600
are you drunk?

00:13:25.600 --> 00:13:32.220
I'm not drunk. I'm really not! I'm not drunk at all.

00:13:32.220 --> 00:13:36.150
Well, you're denying it exactly like a drunk person would.

00:13:37.990 --> 00:13:40.710
I'm completely fine!

00:13:41.350 --> 00:13:43.670
She's not fine at all.

00:13:45.000 --> 00:13:46.510
It looks like Haruna is having fun.

00:13:47.090 --> 00:13:50.720
That's strange... there's no alcohol here.

00:13:51.300 --> 00:13:52.220
Perverts are...

00:13:52.220 --> 00:13:53.390
Kotegawa?!

00:13:53.390 --> 00:13:57.100
Perverts are only allowed to be perverted to me!

00:13:58.600 --> 00:14:00.720
I won't forgive you.

00:14:00.720 --> 00:14:04.230
I won't forgive you unless you do something more perverted to me.

00:14:02.960 --> 00:14:04.230
I can't breathe...

00:14:06.100 --> 00:14:09.070
Thank you, Mikan. I was about to die.

00:14:09.730 --> 00:14:10.820
Onii-chan.

00:14:10.820 --> 00:14:12.740
Onii-chan?

00:14:12.740 --> 00:14:13.990
Onii-chan!

00:14:18.670 --> 00:14:24.400
Onii-chan, I always, always felt...

00:14:22.100 --> 00:14:24.400
Do perverted things to me too, Yuuki-kun. {overlap}

00:14:29.660 --> 00:14:32.510
What's this? I wonder what happened to everyone.

00:14:33.100 --> 00:14:35.180
Suppressed longings, huh?

00:14:37.060 --> 00:14:38.220
Princess.

00:14:38.220 --> 00:14:39.580
Yes, Yami-chan?

00:14:40.770 --> 00:14:42.310
I can see a hot springs bathing area.

00:14:42.310 --> 00:14:43.110
What?

00:14:43.650 --> 00:14:44.650
Where did that come from?

00:14:46.990 --> 00:14:49.880
By the way, it isn't just an illusion I made...

00:14:52.950 --> 00:14:55.210
Oh, you're right!

00:14:55.210 --> 00:14:57.120
Yami-chan, it looks like you're having fun too.

00:14:57.490 --> 00:14:59.710
Sis, that's when you're supposed to make a jab...

00:14:59.710 --> 00:15:02.450
Hey, that's just a normal lake.

00:15:04.250 --> 00:15:07.090
There aren't any hot springs you wear your clothes into.

00:15:07.930 --> 00:15:08.980
I'll be undressing you all.

00:15:11.170 --> 00:15:13.520
This has gotten pretty crazy, hasn't it?

00:15:14.160 --> 00:15:18.240
It looks as though they're reacting differently than Devilukians.

00:15:18.240 --> 00:15:20.010
This is going too far.

00:15:20.010 --> 00:15:22.600
Instead of showing their true characters, they're just getting crazy.

00:15:23.050 --> 00:15:27.110
Y-You're right, but that person...

00:15:38.160 --> 00:15:40.900
Oshizu-chan, this isn't the time to be sleeping.

00:15:40.900 --> 00:15:42.530
You have to hurry up and run away.

00:15:43.850 --> 00:15:45.290
Oshizu-chan?

00:15:45.920 --> 00:15:48.410
Her soul drifted off already!

00:15:51.070 --> 00:15:54.220
{timing this Oh is gay, long line for nothing}Oh, you're so cute, Mikan-chan.

00:15:54.220 --> 00:15:56.300
You think so?

00:15:56.300 --> 00:15:57.890
So much that I want to eat you up.

00:15:57.890 --> 00:15:59.270
Oshizu-chan!

00:15:59.270 --> 00:16:01.270
Yes, what is it?

00:16:01.270 --> 00:16:02.940
Just as I thought.

00:16:02.940 --> 00:16:05.390
Hurry and get out of Sairenji.

00:16:05.390 --> 00:16:08.010
And what if I don't want to?

00:16:08.010 --> 00:16:09.760
Then...

00:16:10.580 --> 00:16:15.490
No! Rito-san, what are you doing, having fun with my body?

00:16:15.490 --> 00:16:19.820
You're so perverted, doing this and that to my body. You're such a pervert...

00:16:19.820 --> 00:16:21.360
{You're such a pervert... }I don't care about you anymore.

00:16:21.360 --> 00:16:23.160
I didn't do anything!

00:16:23.160 --> 00:16:25.000
Rito-kyun!

00:16:30.750 --> 00:16:33.280
If it's with Rito-kun, it's all right.

00:16:36.200 --> 00:16:39.970
Um... I don't think I'm Yuuki-kun.

00:16:39.970 --> 00:16:41.480
My mistake.

00:16:41.480 --> 00:16:43.260
Rito-kyun!

00:16:43.260 --> 00:16:45.480
I'm not him either!

00:16:45.950 --> 00:16:48.000
Then where is he?

00:16:48.000 --> 00:16:48.990
Over there.

00:16:51.340 --> 00:16:53.340
Found you!

00:16:54.140 --> 00:16:55.910
I love you.

00:16:55.910 --> 00:16:58.240
That's the wrong person too!

00:16:58.240 --> 00:17:02.290
Oh? What are you intending to do with my body?

00:17:07.580 --> 00:17:10.170
What happened to everyone?

00:17:10.690 --> 00:17:13.180
Hey Momo, this is getting bad—

00:17:13.180 --> 00:17:14.410
There's something wrong.

00:17:15.820 --> 00:17:18.470
It has absolutely no effect on Rito-san.

00:17:18.470 --> 00:17:21.100
Now that you mention it, it does seems that way.

00:17:21.450 --> 00:17:24.670
Onee-sama's personality is always like this, so she didn't change.

00:17:27.110 --> 00:17:28.050
Let me borrow this.

00:17:36.150 --> 00:17:38.610
What are you doing, Kotegawa?!

00:17:37.970 --> 00:17:40.860
It's not that Rito-san isn't affected. {overlap}

00:17:40.860 --> 00:17:42.440
What do you mean?

00:17:42.440 --> 00:17:45.900
In other words, the outward appearance that he presents...

00:17:45.900 --> 00:17:47.970
is his true character.

00:17:47.970 --> 00:17:49.000
Yami!

00:17:49.980 --> 00:17:51.180
Stop it.

00:17:51.180 --> 00:17:52.170
Oshizu-chan!

00:17:52.170 --> 00:17:53.220
Sairenji!

00:17:53.610 --> 00:17:59.590
He literally has no suppressed longings. Could it possibly be a state of enlightenment, like that of a deity...

00:17:59.590 --> 00:18:01.430
There's no way that's possible.

00:18:01.830 --> 00:18:03.510
Release more pollen.

00:18:03.510 --> 00:18:04.630
But...

00:18:04.630 --> 00:18:05.390
Just do it.

00:18:05.760 --> 00:18:06.890
Sugitani-san.

00:18:17.200 --> 00:18:18.880
What's happening?

00:18:18.880 --> 00:18:21.020
Hey Lala, is this...

00:18:21.020 --> 00:18:23.510
Yeah, it looks like everyone is having fun.

00:18:23.510 --> 00:18:25.040
That's not what I meant!

00:18:25.040 --> 00:18:26.580
More, release more!

00:18:35.280 --> 00:18:36.470
What's that?!

00:18:45.580 --> 00:18:48.940
The wind suddenly changed direction and it got affected by its own pollen.

00:18:51.760 --> 00:18:52.930
At this rate...

00:18:56.590 --> 00:18:58.190
Nana! Momo!

00:18:58.190 --> 00:18:59.500
Sis.

00:18:59.500 --> 00:19:00.400
Onee-sama.

00:19:00.900 --> 00:19:03.360
Don't worry, I'll save you right away, okay?

00:19:04.030 --> 00:19:05.160
Princess.

00:19:06.810 --> 00:19:08.620
Please, leave it to me.

00:19:08.620 --> 00:19:09.910
Yami-chan!

00:19:15.090 --> 00:19:16.590
Yami-chan, that's not it!

00:19:17.420 --> 00:19:18.800
Is that so...

00:19:19.170 --> 00:19:22.550
Then here, or is it here?

00:19:23.110 --> 00:19:24.150
Maybe even here.

00:19:25.610 --> 00:19:26.470
That was close!

00:19:27.090 --> 00:19:28.450
Actually, it's here.

00:19:31.770 --> 00:19:32.830
Yami-chan!

00:19:34.170 --> 00:19:35.270
Lala!

00:19:39.280 --> 00:19:41.120
This is bad. If this keeps up...

00:19:42.090 --> 00:19:43.110
Over here?

00:19:46.870 --> 00:19:48.090
Nana!

00:19:52.970 --> 00:19:54.420
Nana!

00:20:00.100 --> 00:20:01.920
It looks like I made it in time, somehow.

00:20:03.390 --> 00:20:04.590
Are you okay?

00:20:08.510 --> 00:20:09.990
Where do you think you're touching?

00:20:09.990 --> 00:20:12.020
N-No, that was...

00:20:12.330 --> 00:20:14.780
Sorry for being flat!

00:20:14.780 --> 00:20:17.010
Nana, use my dialer!

00:20:17.010 --> 00:20:18.110
Got it.

00:20:22.650 --> 00:20:24.330
It's over for you!

00:20:37.010 --> 00:20:40.970
Did you forget? We're Devilukians.

00:20:40.970 --> 00:20:44.900
Exactly. A height like that is nothing.

00:20:44.900 --> 00:20:46.900
Oh, is that right?

00:20:48.600 --> 00:20:49.430
But...

00:20:51.420 --> 00:20:52.350
Nevermind.

00:20:55.060 --> 00:20:56.510
Hey Rito?

00:20:57.870 --> 00:20:59.320
What are we going to do about that?

00:21:08.070 --> 00:21:13.040
I know I should avert my eyes, but they're going to catch a cold like this!

00:21:13.040 --> 00:21:14.310
It's okay.

00:21:15.550 --> 00:21:17.360
Leave the rest to me.

00:21:17.360 --> 00:21:19.180
I'll leave it to you then.

00:21:19.180 --> 00:21:21.660
Everyone, you'll catch a cold.

00:21:25.380 --> 00:21:26.430
Thank you.

00:21:28.930 --> 00:21:31.600
Come on, wake up, wake up.

00:21:31.600 --> 00:21:34.630
You too, Yami-chan, snap out of it already.{not sure about the 2nd part}

00:21:57.660 --> 00:21:58.720
Rito.

00:21:58.750 --> 00:22:00.040
Rito-san.

00:22:01.410 --> 00:22:03.090
Hey...

00:22:03.830 --> 00:22:06.900
What are you two doing?!

00:22:31.000 --> 00:22:36.270
tamerawa naide gomakasa naide

00:22:31.000 --> 00:22:36.270
Please don't hesitate, please don't trick me.

00:22:37.100 --> 00:22:42.190
docchi ga suki nano icchatte

00:22:37.100 --> 00:22:42.190
Say it, who do you love?

00:22:43.190 --> 00:22:48.410
ibu ga futari ni adamu wa hitori

00:22:43.190 --> 00:22:48.410
Two Eves and one Adam

00:22:48.410 --> 00:22:53.900
rakuen ni wa arashi no yokan

00:22:48.410 --> 00:22:53.900
It feels like there is going to be a storm in heaven.

00:22:54.940 --> 00:23:01.110
madamada suppai wagamama na kajitsu nano

00:22:54.940 --> 00:23:01.110
It's a selfish and still sour fruit

00:23:01.110 --> 00:23:03.670
kuchibiru yoseru tabi

00:23:01.110 --> 00:23:03.670
To get you to put it against your lips…

00:23:03.670 --> 00:23:08.540
hazukashii hodo I WANT YOU

00:23:03.670 --> 00:23:08.540
To the point that it's embarrassing, I WANT YOU

00:23:10.430 --> 00:23:12.850
gaburi

00:23:10.430 --> 00:23:12.850
Gulp!

00:23:12.850 --> 00:23:18.940
kajitte goranyo hayaku hayaku

00:23:12.850 --> 00:23:18.940
Bite it and see! Hurry, hurry

00:23:18.940 --> 00:23:24.490
amai kaori ni kurakura shichau kamo

00:23:18.940 --> 00:23:24.490
You might get dizzy from the sweet smell

00:23:24.490 --> 00:23:30.800
tuyoku kande hagata wa haato maaku

00:23:24.490 --> 00:23:30.800
Bite it hard and your teeth marks leave a heart-impression

00:23:30.800 --> 00:23:33.830
shirarecha ikenai

00:23:30.800 --> 00:23:33.830
You mustn't know

00:23:33.830 --> 00:23:36.710
ringo wa hitotsu shikanaiyo

00:23:33.830 --> 00:23:36.710
There is only one apple.
